    topic "removalDescription"
    p "Section 21, " ["act May 30, 1908, ch. 225, § 6" -> "/us/act/1908-05-30/ch225/s6"] ", " ["35 Stat. 476" -> "/us/stat/35/476"] ", provided that the provisions of sections 17 to 21 of this title not be applicable to locomotives on which an ash pan is not necessary."
